    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d417">

                <pb facs="0588" n="492" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg492"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.52/724: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-09-12T11:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">September 12,
                                1921—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 3:06
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>179. Your telegram number 123, September 10, 5 p.m.<anchor n="99"
                        xml:id="d417-f1"/> The Foreign Office has not even acknowledged receipt of
                    Embassy’s representations concerning Durango and other agrarian laws.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
